    "sentence_translations": [
      "Love at the dinner table",
      "",
      "One day the wife had made several dishes.",
      "When having dinner, the husband kept on taking food to his own bowl.",
      "The wife became very unhappy and said: “Don’t you love me anymore?”",
      "“When we just got married, you always put food in my bowl when we had a meal.”",
      "“Now you only take food for yourself!”",
      "The husband said: “Of course I love you.”",
      "“It’s only because I’ve gotten used to the flavor of the dishes you made. I’m able to eat it now.”"
    ]
